      "each with its projection_id.",
      "",
      "IMPORTANT: a projection vector is only meaningful relative to a stated",
      "engine history, and this is why. Only four of these eighteen are",
      "invariant under appending \u2014 Upstream crossed with {Adjacency,",
      "HopDistance} \u2014 because ancestry is fixed at creation. Degree grows as",
      "children appear, and the Downstream and Undirected node sets grow. So",
      "the other fourteen are reproducible only against exactly the history",
      "below, and an implementation that builds anything else first will",
      "disagree with them while being entirely correct.",
      "",
      "This was found by the vectors failing to reproduce: the generator ran",
      "on a three-synthesis engine while the verifying test had already built",
      "256 byte tips for the lift cases, and the Degree forms disagreed."
    ],
